            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Caroline C"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is the kind of thing my mum would make for me and my brother when we were kids. It's simple, no-frills, hearty comfort food, and pretty inexpensive too. That being said, I think a lot of people are going to find it very bland. I added garlic and onion powders, and made it with homemade chicken stock, and it was still pretty blah. Husband sprinkled hot sauce over his. Not bad, but it needs some tweaking.",
            "datePublished": "2008-12-14T14:35:17.357Z"
          },
